    "encoding_note": "SAS uses 8b10b with running disparity at <=6 Gbps and 128b150b with a forward error correction capability at 12/22.5 Gbps; data dwords are scrambled and each SSP/SMP frame carries a 32-bit CRC. OOB (COMINIT/COMSAS/COMWAKE) plus the Speed Negotiation Window handle attachment detection and rate negotiation."
